      "u": "(a) \"That's an interesting point, and I can see why equality matters. However, I would argue that uniforms suppress individual identity and don't actually address the root causes of bullying. Research suggests that bullying often continues despite uniforms.\" (b) \"Do you think there are other ways schools could promote equality without restricting students' self-expression?\""
