      "bron": "HAVO Engels CE 2022 Tijdvak 1 Presenteren (geen afbeelding)",
      "ctx": "You have given a presentation about food waste in the Netherlands. The examiner asks: \"What do you think individuals can do to reduce food waste at home?\"",
